---
title: Black Bean Tacos
servings: 4
tags: [tacos, vegetarian]
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
---

Heat @olive oil{1%tbsp} in a #skillet{} over medium heat. Cook @onion{1}(diced) until soft, about ~{5%minutes}, then add @garlic{2%cloves}(minced), @ground cumin{2%tsp} and @chili powder{1%tsp} and stir for ~{1%minute}.

Add @black beans{30%oz}(drained and rinsed) and @salt{1/2%tsp}. Cook, mashing lightly, for ~{8%minutes}.

Warm @corn tortillas{12} in a dry #pan{}. Fill with the beans and top with @avocado{2}(sliced), @cilantro{1/2%bunch}(chopped), @cheddar cheese{1%cup}(shredded) and a squeeze of @lime{2}.
